Author-Name: Rudy José Rosas Bazán
Author-Name-First: Rudy José Rosas
Author-Name-Last: Bazán
Title: Hyperopic Strict Topologies
Abstract: We explicitly define a family of seminorms on the space of all bounded real sequence l∞. This family gives rise to a Hausdorff locally convex topology which is not equivalent to the usual ones: the weak topology σ(l∞, l¹), the norm topology τ∞, the Mackey topology m(l∞, l¹) and the strict topology β. We show that this new topology captures a hyperopic behavior of individuals. We call this "hyperopic strict topology". Finally, we show that the hyperopic strict dual of l∞ is not l¹ anymore but rather the set of all finitely additive measures. An interpretation of this hyperopic strict dual is offered in a convenient way.
Creation-Date: 2013-08-21
Number: 23/2013
Classification-JEL: D11, C02
Keywords: Hyperopic agents, locally convex topology, charges
